<opsproc code="00008870.0002001" revdate="2026-02-18T16:36:54"><title>Engine Bleed <abb>IP</abb> Check Valve</title><procdesc code="00008870.0002001.037" lid="N.00008870.0002001.078"><para code="00008870.0002001.038" layer="1" lid="N.00008870.0002001.079"><emph bold="true" italic="false" overline="false" sub="false" sup="false" underline="true">GENERAL INFORMATION</emph></para><note code="00008870.0002001.039" layer="1" lid="N.00008870.0002001.080"><para layer="1" lid="N.00008870.0002001.081">If the bleed of the affected
engine is used while the thrust is reduced (i.e. <tech-label type="pb-sw">ENG 1(2) BLEED</tech-label> is set to OFF too late, or set to ON too early), the following alerts
may trigger:</para><unlist bulltype="NDASH" code="00008870.0002001.040" layer="1" lid="N.00008870.0002001.082"><item layer="1"><para layer="1" lid="N.00008870.0002001.083"><ecam-data ecamimportance="A" type="alert"><ecamsys>AIR</ecamsys><ecamtitle>ENG 1(2) BLEED ABNORM PR</ecamtitle></ecam-data></para></item><item layer="1"><para layer="1" lid="N.00008870.0002001.084"><ecam-data ecamimportance="A" type="alert"><ecamsys>AIR</ecamsys><ecamtitle>ENG 1(2) HP VALVE FAULT</ecamtitle></ecam-data></para></item><item layer="1"><para layer="1" lid="N.00008870.0002001.085"><ecam-data ecamimportance="A" type="alert"><ecamsys>AIR</ecamsys><ecamtitle>PACK 1(2) REGUL FAULT</ecamtitle></ecam-data></para></item></unlist></note></procdesc><procitem layer="1" lid="N.00008870.0002001.062"><title>Flight preparation/Limitations</title><procbody lid="N.00008870.0002001.063"><inform layer="1" lid="N.00008870.0002001.064"><para code="00008870.0002001.031" layer="1" lid="N.00008870.0002001.065">The flight crew should take
into account the severity of forecast icing conditions. At low power
settings, the wing anti-ice will be lost if the opposite engine bleed
air supply system becomes inoperative.</para></inform><condition at-any-time="false" code="00008870.0002001.032" direct="false" layer="1" lid="N.00008870.0002001.066" subtitle="false" type="cond"><intro>If ENG 1 bleed <abb>IP</abb> Check Valve is affected:</intro><procbody lid="N.00008870.0002001.067"><limit layer="1" lid="N.00008870.0002001.068"><lit-limit lid="N.00008870.0002001.069">One engine taxi is not permitted.</lit-limit></limit></procbody></condition></procbody></procitem><procitem layer="1" lid="N.00008870.0002001.005"><title>After start</title><procbody lid="N.00008870.0002001.006"><inform layer="1" lid="N.00008870.0002001.053"><para code="00008870.0002001.027" layer="1" lid="N.00008870.0002001.054"><emph bold="false" italic="false" overline="false" sub="false" sup="false" underline="true">Shortly
after engines start and when the affected engine operates at idle
thrust</emph></para></inform><ex-conditions lid="N.00008870.0002001.041"><condition at-any-time="false" code="00008870.0002001.017" direct="false" layer="1" lid="N.00008870.0002001.035" subtitle="false" type="cond"><intro>If two engine taxi at departure:</intro><procbody lid="N.00008870.0002001.036"><action layer="1" lid="N.00008870.0002001.038" memory="false"><cr-action code="00008870.0002001.018"><challenge><tech-label type="pb-sw">ENG (affected side) BLEED</tech-label></challenge><response>OFF</response></cr-action></action></procbody></condition><condition at-any-time="false" code="00008870.0002001.016" direct="false" layer="1" lid="N.00008870.0002001.033" subtitle="false" type="cond"><intro>If one engine taxi at departure:</intro><procbody lid="N.00008870.0002001.034"><action layer="1" lid="N.00008870.0002001.008" memory="false"><cr-action code="00008870.0002001.002"><challenge><tech-label type="pb-sw">ENG 2 BLEED</tech-label></challenge><response>OFF</response></cr-action></action></procbody></condition></ex-conditions><action layer="1" lid="N.00008870.0002001.009" memory="false"><cr-action code="00008870.0002001.003"><challenge><tech-label type="sel">X BLEED</tech-label></challenge><response>OPEN</response></cr-action></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00008870.0002001.012" memory="false"><cr-action code="00008870.0002001.005"><challenge><tech-label type="pb-sw">One PACK</tech-label></challenge><response>OFF</response></cr-action></action></procbody></procitem><procitem layer="1" lid="N.00008870.0002001.013"><title>Before takeoff</title><procbody lid="N.00008870.0002001.014"><action-block lid="N.00008870.0002001.015"><title>Just before applying takeoff thrust</title><action layer="1" lid="N.00008870.0002001.016" memory="false"><cr-action code="00008870.0002001.006"><challenge><tech-label type="pb-sw">ENG (affected side)
BLEED</tech-label></challenge><response>On</response></cr-action><comment code="00008870.0002001.026"><para layer="1" lid="N.00008870.0002001.052">In order to prevent the triggering
of <abb>ECAM</abb> alerts, the flight crew must be careful not to
set <tech-label type="pb-sw">ENG 1(2) BLEED</tech-label> to On too early before the takeoff
power is set.</para></comment></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00008870.0002001.017" memory="false"><cr-action code="00008870.0002001.007"><challenge><tech-label type="sel">X BLEED</tech-label></challenge><response>AUTO</response></cr-action></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00008870.0002001.020" memory="false"><cr-action code="00008870.0002001.009"><challenge><tech-label type="pb-sw">PACK</tech-label></challenge><response>On</response></cr-action></action></action-block></procbody></procitem><procitem layer="1" lid="N.00008870.0002001.021"><title>BEFORE DESCENT</title><procbody lid="N.00008870.0002001.022"><action-block lid="N.00008870.0002001.023"><title>Shortly before descent and until engines shutdown</title><action layer="1" lid="N.00008870.0002001.024" memory="false"><cr-action code="00008870.0002001.010"><challenge><tech-label type="pb-sw">ENG (affected side)
BLEED</tech-label></challenge><response>OFF</response></cr-action></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00008870.0002001.025" memory="false"><cr-action code="00008870.0002001.011"><challenge><tech-label type="sel">X BLEED</tech-label></challenge><response>OPEN</response></cr-action></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00008870.0002001.028" memory="false"><cr-action code="00008870.0002001.013"><challenge><tech-label type="pb-sw">One PACK</tech-label></challenge><response>OFF</response></cr-action></action></action-block></procbody></procitem></opsproc>